  "published": "2025-08-03T03:38:41.877Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.4.0:\n            - (Released: 3 August 2025) - Enhanced CSV converters with advanced functionality matching XML converter capabilities.\n            - Significantly improved CsvToJsonConverter with support for grouped data, nested objects, array conversion, and automatic data type detection.\n            - Enhanced CsvToPdfConverter with auto-fit columns, alternate row colors, landscape orientation, row numbering, and comprehensive document metadata.\n            - Upgraded CsvToWordConverter with hierarchical data representation, customizable table styles, alternate row colors, page orientation settings, and statistical summaries.\n            - Completely rewritten CsvToXmlConverter with multiple output formats (elements, attributes, mixed, hierarchical), custom naming conventions, data grouping, sorting capabilities, and flexible metadata control.\n            - New advanced CsvToYamlConverter with multiple structure formats (array, dictionary, hierarchical, grouped), smart data type conversion, multiline text handling, and comprehensive formatting options.\n            - Improved all CSV converters with consistent option handling, extensive customization parameters, and robust error handling.\n            - Enhanced data type detection and conversion across all formats with support for dates, numbers, booleans, and arrays.\n            - Implemented advanced features like data grouping, sorting, filtering, and hierarchical representation.\n            - Significantly improved code maintainability and consistency across all converter classes.\n            - Fixed XML output generation to exclude unnecessary comments and metadata by default while maintaining backward compatibility.\n            - Enhanced performance and memory efficiency for large dataset processing.",
